0012INPUT USING MAP "WK36HMP2"
0013/**decide on the value of selection
0014DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
0015  WHEN #SELECT(1) = 'X'
0016    MOVE 'W' TO #MARITAL
0017    MOVE 'WIDOWED' TO #M-DESCR 
0018  WHEN #SELECT(2) = 'X'
